# Requests for the notes example. Run `npm run seed` first.
# Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client.
# Tip: copy this file for every resource you build and use it as test evidence.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@password = password1234

### 1. Sign in as a member (the session cookie is remembered)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "member@demo.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 2. List my notes (members only see their own)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes

### 3. Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?status=open

### 4. Counts by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/stats

### 5. Create a note -> 201. The status is always "open", even if you send another one.
# @name created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Call the technician", "content": "Projector in room 12", "dueDate": "2026-12-01" }

### 6. Validation error -> 400 with per-field errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x", "dueDate": "not-a-date" }

### 7. Same title twice -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Call the technician" }

### 8. Update the note created in step 5
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{created.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "done" }

### 9. Members cannot archive -> 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{created.response.body.id}}/archive

### 10. Sign in as the manager
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "manager@demo.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 11. Managers see everyone's notes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes

### 12. Managers can archive -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{created.response.body.id}}/archive

### 13. Archived notes cannot be edited -> 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{created.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Too late" }

### 14. Delete -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{created.response.body.id}}

### 15. Better Auth admin endpoint: list users (managers only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/admin/list-users
Origin: http://localhost:5173
